OL,4,BAntonelli fastest but penalty leaves   
OL,5,BVerstappen on pole                     
OL,6,GMercedes' Kimi Antonelli was fastest   
OL,7,Gin qualifying for the Las Vegas Grand  
OL,8,GPrix but a grid penalty will hand pole 
OL,9,Gposition to Red Bull's Max Verstappen. 
OL,11,FAntonelli, running at the back of the  
OL,12,Fpack of cars in qualifying and         
OL,13,Fmaximising his tow, beat Verstappen by 
OL,14,F0.258 seconds.                         
OL,16,FBut the new world champion has a five- 
OL,17,Fplace grid penalty for using more than 
OL,18,Fpermitted number of engine components  
OL,19,Fand will start sixth.                  
